; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">数量</span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:45%; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; height:30px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">简要技术需求或服务要求</span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:6%; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; height:30px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">01</span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; height:30px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">清华大学早期建筑——平斋修缮工程设计服务</span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:14%; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; height:30px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">91.00</span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; height:30px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项</span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:45%; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; height:30px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">按照国家文物局2013年发布的《文物保护工程设计文件编制深度要求（试行）》、2016年版建设部《建筑工程设计文件编制深度规定》标准完成主体设计的全套方案设计、初步设计（含设计概算）和施工图设计文件。同时，完成主体设计协调服务、全楼室内精装修设计（含机电配合设计）、用地范围内的市政管线及环境设计、智能化设计、BIM设计等专项设计。此外，一并完成文物建筑现状勘察与现状测绘，形成勘察报告与测绘图纸。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">详见第四章采购需求。</span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n  </tbody> \n </table> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"tab-stops:45.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\">5.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">合同履行期限：设计周期</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\">126</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日历天</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">。其中方案设计</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\">28</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日历天，初步设计（含设计概算）</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\">42</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日历天，施工图设计</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\">56</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日历天。同时，配合施工自项目开工之日起，至项目竣工之日止。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\">6.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">本项目是否接受联合体响应：</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\">□</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">是</span></span></span>  <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">■</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">否。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"page-break-after:avoid\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><a name=\"_Toc35393791\"></a><a name=\"_Toc191481372\"></a><a name=\"_Toc191481347\"></a><a name=\"_Toc191623378\"></a><a name=\"_Toc35393622\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28359003\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28359080\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">二、申请人的资格要求（须同时满足）</span></span></span></b></a></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"tab-stops:45.0pt 99.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">1.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">满足《中华人民共和国政府采购法》第二十二条规定；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"tab-stops:45.0pt 99.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><a name=\"_Toc28359004\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28359081\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2.</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">通过“信用中国”网站（www.creditchina.gov.cn）和中国政府采购网（www.ccgp.gov.cn）查询信用记录（截止时点为响应截止时间），被列入失信被执行人、重大税收违法失信主体、政府采购严重违法失信行为记录名单的供应商，没有资格参加本项目的采购活动。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><sp